</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Working of HTML Hyperlinks</h1>
<div class="roll">Roll Number: 25K65A1203</div>
<div class="box">
<h2>Hyperlinks using &lt;a&gt;, href and target</h2>
<p><a href="https://www.google.com" target="_blank">Open Google</a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.youtube.com" target="_blank">Open YouTube</a></p>
<p><a href="https://www.wikipedia.org" target="_self">Open Wikipedia</a></p>
</div>
</body>
